ass="site-page" href="/archives/"><i class="fa-fw fas fa-archive"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">逻辑漏洞</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-03-22T12:43:46.000Z" title="发表于 2025-03-22 20:43:46">2025-03-22</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-24T02:16:02.475Z" title="更新于 2025-04-24 10:16:02">2025-04-24</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="逻辑漏洞"><a href="#逻辑漏洞" class="headerlink" title="逻辑漏洞"></a>逻辑漏洞</h1><h2 id="越权"><a href="#越权" class="headerlink" title="越权"></a>越权</h2><h3 id="越权原理"><a href="#越权原理" class="headerlink" title="越权原理"></a>越权原理</h3><p><strong>原理：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>水平越权：同权限用户间非法访问他人资源（如用户A查用户B订单）。</li>
<li>垂直越权：低权限用户执行高权限操作（如普通用户调用管理员接口）。</li>
<li>根源：后端未校验请求归属权或角色权限。</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>典型场景：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>用户ID篡改：修改亲求中的<code>user_id</code>参数访问他人数据</li>
<li>角色标识伪造：修改<code>Cookie</code>或Header中角色值为<code>admin</code></li>
<li>功能接口未鉴权：直接调用管理员接口（<code>/admin/deleteUser</code>）</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="越权利用"><a href="#越权利用" class="headerlink" title="越权利用"></a>越权利用</h3><p><strong>水平越权攻击手法：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>URL参数篡改：用户A将<code>12345</code>改为<code>67890</code>访问用户B的订单</p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">GET</span> <span class="string">/api/order?user_id=12345</span> <span class="meta">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>POST请求参数劫持:篡改<code>user_id</code>为他人账户</p>
<figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">POST /update_profile HTTP/<span class="number">1.1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span><span class="attr">&quot;user_id&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="string">&quot;attacker&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span> <span class="attr">&quot;email&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span><span class="string">&quot;hacker@example.com&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>文件路径遍历：通过路径越权访问系统文件</p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">GET</span> <span class="string">/download?file=../../etc/passwd</span> <span class="meta">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>垂直越权攻击手法：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p><code>Cookie/Hearder</code>伪造：修改普通用户的<code>role</code>值为<code>admin</code></p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">GET</span> <span class="string">/admin/dashboard</span> <span class="meta">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attribute">Cookie</span><span class="punctuation">: </span>role=admin; session=xyz123 </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>隐藏API探测：直接调用未公开的管理员接口</p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">POST</span> <span class="string">/internal/admin/deleteAllUsers</span> <span class="meta">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>功能参数调用：普通用户创建管理员账户</p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">POST</span> <span class="string">/create_user</span> <span class="meta">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;&quot;username&quot;:&quot;victim&quot;, &quot;role&quot;:&quot;superadmin&quot;&#125; </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="越权防御"><a href="#越权防御" class="headerlink" title="越权防御"></a>越权防御</h3><p><strong>强制权限校验：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>后端统一鉴权：所有亲求必须经过权限验证层，而非依赖前端传递的参数</p>
<figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// Spring Security示例：从会话获取用户真实身份</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">@PreAuthorize(&quot;#userId == authentication.principal.id&quot;)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> User <span class="title function_">getUserProfile</span><span class="params">(String userId)</span> &#123; ...</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>数据归属验证：操作资源前检查用户所有权</p>
<figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">SELECT</span> <span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">FROM</span> orders <span class="keyword">WHERE</span> order_id <span class="operator">=</span> ? <span class="keyword">AND</span> user_id <span class="operator">=</span> ?  <span class="operator">/</span><span class="operator">/</span> <span class="keyword">SQL</span>中绑定当前用户ID</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>接口最小化暴露：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>隐藏管理接口：通过路由规则或网关限制访问（如仅允许内网IP访问<code>/admin/*</code>）</li>
<li>API版本控制：区别普通用户与管理员API版本</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="越权绕过"><a href="#越权绕过" class="headerlink" title="越权绕过"></a>越权绕过</h3><p><strong>水平越权绕过技巧：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>批量ID遍历：使用递增&#x2F;可预测的<code>ID</code>（如<code>1001</code>,<code>1002</code>）枚举他人数据。</li>
<li>UUID预测：若系统使用伪随机<code>UUID</code>，尝试构造特定模式（如时间戳部分）</li>
<li>参数污染：同时传递多个参数混淆逻辑（如<code>user_id=123&amp;username=hack</code>）</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>垂直越权绕过技巧：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>低权限接口提权：利用地权限接口中的功能链接触发高权限操作</p>
</li>
<li><p>HTTP方法篡改：将<code>GET</code>改为<code>POST</code>或<code>PUT</code>访问受限接口</p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">PUT</span> <span class="string">/admin/config</span> <span class="meta">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>JWT令牌篡改：解码JWT修改<code>role</code>字段后重新签名（若密匙弱或未验证签名）</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 修改JWT载荷中的角色</span></span><br><span class="line">payload = &#123;<span class="string">&quot;user&quot;</span>:<span class="string">&quot;attacker&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;role&quot;</span>:<span class="string">&quot;admin&quot;</span>&#125;</span><br><span class="line">token = jwt.encode(payload, weak_key, algorithm=<span class="string">&quot;HS256&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>结合其他漏洞：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>信息泄露+越权：通过报错信息获取用户ID格式，再发起越权请求</li>
<li>CSRF+越权：构造恶意页面诱导管理员点击，触发越权操作</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="验证机制绕过漏洞"><a href="#验证机制绕过漏洞" class="headerlink" title="验证机制绕过漏洞"></a>验证机制绕过漏洞</h2><h3 id="原理"><a href="#原理" class="headerlink" title="原理"></a>原理</h3><ul>
<li>关键操作（如登录、支付）的验证步骤存在逻辑缺陷，允许跳过或伪造验证。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="利用"><a href="#利用" class="headerlink" title="利用"></a>利用</h3><ul>
<li><p>验证码失效:重复提交同一验证码  </p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">POST</span> <span class="string">/login</span> <span class="meta">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-apache"><span class="attribute">captcha</span>=<span class="number">1234</span>&amp;used=<span class="number">1</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>短信轰炸:自动化脚本发送大量验证请求 </p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:  </span><br><span class="line">    requests.post(<span class="string">&#x27;/sendSms&#x27;</span>, data=&#123;<span class="string">&#x27;phone&#x27;</span>:<span class="string">&#x27;13800000000&#x27;</span>&#125;)  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>OTP跳过:直接跳过短信验证步骤  </p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">POST /resetPassword  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="防御"><a href="#防御" class="headerlink" title="防御"></a>防御</h3><ul>
<li><p>多因素认证（MFA）</p>
<figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="title class_">Set</span>-<span class="title class_">Cookie</span>: session=xyz; <span class="title class_">Secure</span>; <span class="title class_">SameSite</span>=<span class="title class_">Strict</span>  </span><br><span class="line">X-<span class="variable constant_">OTP</span>-<span class="title class_">Required</span>: <span class="literal">true</span>  # 强制二次验证  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>验证码绑定会话: <code>Django</code>示例：验证码与<code>Session</code>绑定  </p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">request.session[<span class="string">&#x27;captcha&#x27;</span>] = random_code  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>频率限制: Nginx限速配置（1分钟5次） </p>
<figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attribute">limit_req_zone</span> <span class="variable">$binary_remote_addr</span> zone=auth:<span class="number">10m</span> rate=5r/m;  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="绕过"><a href="#绕过" class="headerlink" title="绕过"></a>绕过</h3><ul>
<li>验证码OCR识别：使用<code>Tesseract</code>或深度学习模型破解图形验证码。</li>
<li>中间人攻击截获：通过<code>WiFi</code>劫持获取短信验证码。</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="业务参数篡改漏洞"><a href="#业务参数篡改漏洞" class="headerlink" title="业务参数篡改漏洞"></a>业务参数篡改漏洞</h2><h3 id="原理-1"><a href="#原理-1" class="headerlink" title="原理"></a>原理</h3><ul>
<li>用户可修改请求中的业务参数（如价格、数量），后端未校验合法性。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="利用-1"><a href="#利用-1" class="headerlink" title="利用"></a>利用</h3><ul>
<li><p>价格负数攻击:</p>
<figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">POST /checkout  </span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span><span class="attr">&quot;product_id&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="number">1001</span><span class="punctuation">,</span> <span class="attr">&quot;price&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="number">-100</span><span class="punctuation">,</span> <span class="attr">&quot;quantity&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="number">1</span><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span>  # 总价<span class="number">-100</span>元  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>无限优惠券: 重复使用同一优惠码 </p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">POST</span> <span class="string">/applyCoupon</span>  <span class="string">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">coupon_code=SUPER100&amp;repeat=999</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="防御-1"><a href="#防御-1" class="headerlink" title="防御"></a>防御</h3><ul>
<li><p>后端强校验</p>
<figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 价格必须从数据库读取，而非前端提交  </span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">double</span> <span class="variable">price</span> <span class="operator">=</span> productDao.getPriceById(productId);  </span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> (requestPrice != price) <span class="keyword">throw</span> <span class="keyword">new</span> <span class="title class_">InvalidPriceException</span>();  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>参数签名</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 使用HMAC签名防止篡改  </span></span><br><span class="line">signature = hmac.new(secret_key, params.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="绕过-1"><a href="#绕过-1" class="headerlink" title="绕过"></a>绕过</h3><ul>
<li>嵌套结构注入：<figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span>  </span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;order&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span>  </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">&quot;discount&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="punctuation">&#123;</span>  </span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;malicious&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span>   </span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">&quot;value&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;&#x27;; DROP TABLE users; --&quot;</span>  </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span>  </span><br><span class="line">  <span class="punctuation">&#125;</span>  </span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="业务流程绕过漏洞"><a href="#业务流程绕过漏洞" class="headerlink" title="业务流程绕过漏洞"></a>业务流程绕过漏洞</h2><h3 id="原理-2"><a href="#原理-2" class="headerlink" title="原理"></a>原理</h3><ul>
<li>攻击者跳过正常业务流程步骤（如未支付直接发货）。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="利用-2"><a href="#利用-2" class="headerlink" title="利用"></a>利用</h3><ul>
<li><p>直接调用终态接口:跳过支付步骤 </p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">POST /order/ship</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>状态码修改：未支付订单改为已完成</p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">PATCH /order/1001  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;&quot;status&quot;: &quot;completed&quot;&#125; </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="防御-2"><a href="#防御-2" class="headerlink" title="防御"></a>防御</h3><ul>
<li><p>状态机校验：检查订单状态变迁合法性  </p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> current_status != <span class="string">&#x27;paid&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">and</span> new_status == <span class="string">&#x27;shipped&#x27;</span>:  </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">raise</span> InvalidStateTransition()  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>幂等令牌：确保支付仅执行一次</p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">POST /payOrder  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attribute">X-Idempotency-Key</span><span class="punctuation">: </span>a1b2c3d4</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="绕过-2"><a href="#绕过-2" class="headerlink" title="绕过"></a>绕过</h3><ul>
<li>逆向隐藏接口：通过前端源码发现未保护的API端点。</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="条件竞争漏洞"><a href="#条件竞争漏洞" class="headerlink" title="条件竞争漏洞"></a>条件竞争漏洞</h2><h3 id="原理-3"><a href="#原理-3" class="headerlink" title="原理"></a>原理</h3><ul>
<li>高并发请求导致资源竞争，引发数据不一致。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="利用-3"><a href="#利用-3" class="headerlink" title="利用"></a>利用</h3><ul>
<li><p>重复领取优惠券: 并发请求脚本  </p>
<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> &#123;1..100&#125;; <span class="keyword">do</span> curl http://api.com/claimCoupon &amp; <span class="keyword">done</span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>余额双花攻击：并发转账导致余额计算错误  </p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">transfer</span>():  </span><br><span class="line">    requests.post(<span class="string">&#x27;/transfer&#x27;</span>, data=&#123;<span class="string">&#x27;amount&#x27;</span>: <span class="number">100</span>&#125;)  </span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">with</span> ThreadPoolExecutor(<span class="number">50</span>) <span class="keyword">as</span> executor:  </span><br><span class="line">    executor.<span class="built_in">map</span>(transfer, <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">100</span>))  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="防御-3"><a href="#防御-3" class="headerlink" title="防御"></a>防御</h3><ul>
<li><p>数据库锁机制</p>
<figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">SELECT</span> <span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">FROM</span> accounts <span class="keyword">WHERE</span> user_id <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="number">123</span> <span class="keyword">FOR</span> <span class="keyword">UPDATE</span>; </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>Redis分布式锁:使用Redlock算法  </p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">with</span> redlock.lock(<span class="string">&quot;coupon_lock&quot;</span>, <span class="number">1000</span>):  </span><br><span class="line">    claim_coupon()  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="绕过-3"><a href="#绕过-3" class="headerlink" title="绕过"></a>绕过</h3><ul>
<li>分布式节点攻击：从多IP发起并发请求绕过单节点锁。</li>
</ul>
